OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive dead and 86 missing as
OL,4,A'heartbreaking' fire breaks out on
OL,5,APhilippines ferry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe blaze, which erupted at 18:45 local
OL,8,Ftime (10:45 GMT) Wednesday, was still
OL,9,Fburning as of 11:00 on Thursday. The
OL,10,Fstrong currents and thick smoke were a
OL,11,Fchallenge to those working to
OL,12,Fextinguish it, the coastguard said.
OL,14,FA survivor says he was in the sea for
OL,15,Ftwo hours before he got rescued. "It
OL,16,Fwas cold. If the rescue was delayed, I
OL,17,Fwould definitely have died," Roland
OL,18,FLerma told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
